# SCALE-Sim run scratch — every AttentionMappingProblem.evaluate() call's
# topology.csv/layout.csv/config.cfg + SCALE-Sim's full per-layer trace CSVs.
# Large (a 330-evaluation Experiment 0 run produced ~3.5GB / 32,500 files here) and
# fully regenerable from a re-run; NOT itself a logged result — every metric it
# could offer is already in results/raw/*.csv, which IS tracked, since that CSV
# (plus results/processed/, results/figures/) is the evidence the plan's ground
# rules require to persist (plan §4, ground rule 2).
**/results/raw/_scratch/

# Claude Code local tool state (not project content).
.claude/
